WEBVTT

00:17:57.871 --> 00:18:01.621
and it's almost, if there was ever
a moment to really show the world

00:18:01.663 --> 00:18:04.996
that this is being done
to make a better future,

00:18:05.038 --> 00:18:07.829
that is actually key to Google's future,

00:18:07.871 --> 00:18:09.621
as well as all of ours.

00:18:09.663 --> 00:18:10.829
JD: Indeed.

00:18:10.871 --> 00:18:13.454
CA: It's very good to hear you
come and say that, Jeff.

00:18:13.454 --> 00:18:15.496
Thank you so much for coming here to TED.

00:18:15.538 --> 00:18:16.704
JD: Thank you.

00:18:16.704 --> 00:18:17.871
(Applause)